initial.checklistText:
      Outside-review checklist
      This is the shortest handoff path for someone arriving cold: boundary, clean launch, reviewer pass, receipt, observation triage, optional diagnostics, and exportable review notes.
      OR-01: Read boundary before launching Launcher boundary explicitly says deterministic browser-local shell, no LLM, no consciousness, no moral patienthood, no production persistence, and no finished gameplay.Mark done
OR-02: Launch clean reviewer path Launch clean demo opens the maintained v61 shell with reviewer-focus mode, not a parallel simulation.Mark done
OR-03: Run reviewer pass inside the shell Reviewer landing reports PASSABLE_REVIEW_PATH and the integrated scenario receipt reports ALL_PASS.Mark done
OR-04: Inspect transcript, receipt, and observation triage Session transcript, integrated receipt, and observation triage are visible before optional deep panels.Mark done
OR-05: Audit failures if the receipt is incomplete Audit failures converts failing receipt fields into blocking observation rows with recovery guidance.Mark done
OR-06: Reveal deep panels only for unresolved questions Toggle deep panels exposes trace, checkpoints, resident history, social memory, receipt observations, playtest tasks, and QA manifest.Mark done
OR-07: Record manual outcome and export handoff Manual pass recorder, defect ledger, and outside-review handoff export are prepared as browser-local public review evidence.Mark done

